---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms and Conditions | StudyPath"><main class="container py-14"><a class="text-sm font-bold text-teal-700" href={base}>← Back to StudyPath</a><article class="surface mt-6 p-7 md:p-10"><h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">Terms and Conditions</h1><p class="muted mt-5 max-w-4xl leading-8">StudyPath is provided for general educational planning. Verify all programme, fee, scholarship, admission and visa information with the relevant official institution or authority before acting. No admission, funding, employment or visa outcome is guaranteed. Do not misuse the website or infringe third-party intellectual property. External websites are operated independently. Content and these terms may be updated. These notes are informational and are not legal advice.</p></article></main></BaseLayout>